    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Initiate of the Great Work.</strong> Sleep is a meeting place, not a refuge.</p><ul><li>Once per Soma Break, you may choose to reroll the lowest die on an Insight (Soul) checks, a Soul check, or a Presence check as you call upon the Dream for guidance.</li><li>You may ask the Dream one question each a Soma Break—an omen, a vector, or a hidden connection. The Dream does not lie, but neither is it always literal.</li></ul>",
